WEBVTT

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:02.276
Na nikakutana na wakulima,
ndugu wa Guarnizo.

00:11:02.324 --> 00:11:05.500
Ni shamba dogo, wanatengeneza kahawa
nzuri

00:11:05.564 --> 00:11:08.320
wanalipwa juu ya kiwango
cha biashara kwa sababu hio.

00:11:08.554 --> 00:11:11.090
Na wakanionyesha
jinsi kahawa inavyokua.

00:11:11.184 --> 00:11:15.320
Buni kiukweli iko ndani ya
tunda liitwalo cheri ya kahawa.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.206
Na nikawashukuru.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.166
Na wakasema,
"Basi, tusingeweza kufanya kazi yetu

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.136
bila wati 100 wengine."

00:11:23.374 --> 00:11:27.640
Machine inayomenya hilo tunda
inatengenezwa Brazil,

00:11:27.684 --> 00:11:30.520
na lori la kubebea
wanalozunguka nalo shambani,